WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:04.920
For the iconic role of the Joker in Suicide
Squad, Jared Leto got into incredible shape

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.230
and focused on building serious muscle definition.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.440
Now, he's hitting the gym again to get ready
to star as the title character in the upcoming

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.300
Spider-Man spinoff film, Morbius.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.340
The personal training sessions for Suicide
Squad were no joke.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.240
Under the guidance of trainer Brendan Johnston,
the entire cast got fit together while staying

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.620
at a training facility in Toronto for what
they described as "boot camp."

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.440
Johnston had specific exercises in mind for
each cast member, depending on what their

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.820
character would be doing on screen.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:36.260
According to Men's Journal, Johnston wanted
Leto to look like an MMA fighter by the time

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.240
he was done working with him.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.540
How did he achieve that?

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:43.740
For starters, Leto's regular workouts consisted
of plenty of bodybuilding exercises and weighted

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:44.300
calisthenics.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:49.400
He also practiced boxing, and Johnston noted
that Leto was, quote, "throwing a lot of punches

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:49.940
throughout the day."

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.340
Leto's regular routines also included daily
cardio.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.760
The cast typically got one day off after every
four days they spent in the gym, so there

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.200
was also some mandatory rest time.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.100
Leto is living proof that you don't need to
eat meat in order to build muscle.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.180
According to an interview with GQ, Leto has
been vegan for over two decades.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:11.940
Clearly, it's working out pretty well for
him, as he credits his vegan lifestyle for

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:12.480
his health.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.280
He does admit to cheating every once in a
while and indulging in treats that contain

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.280
milk or eggs.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.840
But he draws the line at consuming meat, even
on special occasions.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:26.180
A vegan chef comes on tour with Thirty Seconds
to Mars — even when the band did their "Carnivores

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:30.100
Tour" with Linkin Park, Leto was still fueling
up on fruits and vegetables backstage.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.500
In 2014, he was named PETA's "Sexiest Vegan."

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:37.820
To get ready to play the Joker, Leto had to
eat every two hours throughout the day to

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:40.540
keep his energy up and his metabolism working
hard.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.380
So, what's Leto's number one fitness secret?

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:48.459
His primary piece of advice is something that
seems so obvious, yet many people still underestimate

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:49.200
its importance.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.980
When it comes to looking your best, Leto told
Rolling Stone,

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.640
"I would tell everyone to sleep as much as
you can."

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:58.680
With his crazy schedule, he knows that it's
crucial to get that full eight hours of sleep

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.620
every night.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:04.409
From concerts to the gym to the recording
studio to the set of whatever film he's working

00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:07.780
on, he needs to be able to perform at his
best every moment of the day.

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:11.780
Some people assume that musicians and actors
would rather go out every night than crawl

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:14.300
into bed early, but for Leto, this isn't the
case.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:19.200
It's easy to assume that an actor who dives
deeply into their roles like Leto might be

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.560
experimenting with certain substances off
screen.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:25.620
After all, he did live on the street with
addicts to prepare for his role in Requiem

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:26.160
for a Dream.

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:30.360
But even then, Leto didn't partake, and he
says that at this point, he's been totally

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:33.040
straight edge for many years — no drugs
or alcohol.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:37.379
Leto admitted to getting into some trouble
in his younger days due to his previous alcohol

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.020
and drug use.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.939
However, he eventually changed his ways, and
he knows that he made the right choice.

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.120
He told Rolling Stone,

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.760
"I guess at some point, too, there's a decision:
Is this going to be my life?

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:51.140
I made a choice to pursue other dreams…
the risk versus reward is out of line.

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.340
I just saw too many examples of what not to
do."

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:58.260
Leto hasn't yet given any specific details
about his workouts for Morbius.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.940
However, he does post pretty frequently on
Instagram.

00:03:01.329 --> 00:03:04.599
So far, it looks like he's been working out
on his elliptical, and he also says that he's

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:07.840
been going for daily morning bike rides — even
while he's on tour.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.480
Of course, touring is a workout in itself.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:19.840
"It's kind of like a master spinning aerobics
class, Richard Simmons would be proud."

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.680
Although he hasn't posted about any bodybuilding
workouts yet, he's most likely sticking with

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.500
a lifting routine as well.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.700
Rock climbing is also one of Leto's favorite
hobbies.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.280
Whether he's trying to get in shape for a
particular role or not, he always makes time

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:32.840
to climb.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:37.260
He told Rolling Stone climbing is also a form
of stress relief for him, and a way to stay

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.220
balanced in the chaotic world of Hollywood.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:44.110
Morbius isn't due out for release until July
2020, with shooting having commenced in March

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:44.780
2019.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:48.620
But you can bet, with his unmatched commitment
to his work, Leto is sure to deliver as the

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.180
star.

